Fixes:
- Count time on a clock of 30 frames a second, the rate it was made for, so a 60 fps project plays it at the same speed.
- Mount the shader with the blob shape's clamp arguments in order: clamp(0., 1., length(…)) has its bounds swapped, which graphics cards read as min(1., length(…)) but software drawing reads as 1, so the blobs vanished under Software drawing.

